     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Hello Users, </font></div><div><font face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Hoping to have someone shed some light on the output below and either confirm or negate my interpretation. </font></div><div><font face=\"arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\"><font size=\"2\">I used the DM pcountOpen model following Hostetler-Chandler code for a long-term raptor dataset. The best model <font color=\"#000000\">had factors for initial population size\r\n(“lambda”), immigration (“iota”:<span>  </span>immigration=TRUE</font><font color=\"#000000\">) , a density\r\ndependent change in population size (“omega”:</font><span><font color=\"#000000\"> \r\n</font></span><font color=\"#000000\">dynamics=&quot;gompertz&quot;</font><font color=\"#000000\">),</font><span><font color=\"#000000\">  </font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\">detection</font> <font size=\"2\">probabilities dependent on the\r\npresence or absence of another species, and classical population growth (“gamma”).<font face=\"Calibri\"></font></font></font></font></font></font><font face=\"Calibri\"></font><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><strong>\r\n</strong>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">Here is a table of the parameter\r\nestimates from the model with the smallest AIC value:</font></span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\"><img width=\"320\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/attach/7718996397698/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%201?part=0.1\"></font></span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The\r\nestimate of the population growth rate is less than one (</span><span style=\"line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><img width=\"111\" height=\"19\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/attach/7718996397698/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%202?part=0.2\"></span><span style=\"line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">) but there is a positive immigration effect (</span><span style=\"line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><img width=\"107\" height=\"19\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/attach/7718996397698/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%203?part=0.3\"></span><span style=\"line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">).<span> </span></span></font></font></span></p><span><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:11pt\"><span><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\"></font></font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\"><span>If </span><span style=\"line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><img width=\"16\" height=\"19\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/attach/7718996397698/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%204?part=0.4\"></span><span><span> </span>is the initial population size, then the\r\nestimate of </span><span style=\"line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><img width=\"16\" height=\"19\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/attach/7718996397698/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%205?part=0.5\"></span><span><span> </span>is </span><span style=\"line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><img width=\"43\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/attach/7718996397698/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%206?part=0.6\"></span><span>.<span>  </span>For future year t  <span style=\"line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span>the estimate is found (for this particular\r\n“gomperz” model) in the following manner: <font size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></span></span></span></font></font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><font size=\"3\"><img width=\"352\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/attach/7718996397698/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%207?part=0.7\"><span style=\"line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><font size=\"3\"><font size=\"3\"></font></font></span></font></span></font></font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\"><font size=\"3\"><font size=\"3\"><font size=\"3\"><span>Plugging in the estimates results in the\r\nfollowing predictions:</span></font></font></font></font></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\"><font size=\"3\"><font size=\"3\"><font size=\"3\"><span><br></span></font></font></font></font></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\"><font size=\"3\"><font size=\"3\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n<img width=\"133\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/attach/7718996397698/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%208?part=0.8\"></font></font></font></font></font></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\"><font size=\"3\"><font size=\"3\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">Is this correct? So despite a population growth rate &lt;1 there is no evidence for a downward population trend?</font></font></font></font></font></font></p></p></p></p></span></span><p></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></font></font></p><div align=\"center\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><br></p></font></font></font></div><p></p></p></font></span><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></font></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></font></font></p><p></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></font></font></p><p></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></font></p><p></p><p></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\"><span><br></span></font></font></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n<br></font></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><br></font></p><p></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><br></p><p></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: