     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>hi Michelle,</div><div> I think probably the baseline growth rate is exp(0.496) = 1.64  and this gets adjusted a bit due to the density dependence.  This might make more sense with respect to  your estimates.  Maybe you can confirm this by simulating a simple example....</div><div>regards,</div><div>andy</div><div><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div>"
    ],
